<title>INDIA: India's Pfizer 1996/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India's Pfizer 1996/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		185.3	 vs	 107.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	     2,629.0	 vs     2,526.0</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	   4.0	 vs	   n.a.</p>
<p>    Other income	    209.8	 vs	  58.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   2,461.4	 vs     2,305.9</p>
<p>    Interest		   35.8	 vs	  57.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     43.7	 vs	  36.2</p>
<p>    Tax			 112.6	 vs	  78.5</p>
<p>Note: Pfizer Ltd said its other income for 1996/97 included a profit of 54.44 million rupees on sale and discard of fixed assets and 17.25 million rupees from restructuring.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
